    {
      "id": "claim_b6cd21954f5f4a4c8430b0ebfa928d71",
      "statement": "Alpine base image bumps are compatibility-gated: update-moodle-semver.py reads alpinelinux.org/releases.json, skips edge, end-of-life branches, and branches without releases, and selects the newest newer branch whose main and community x86_64 APKINDEX provide every apk add package (names or provides aliases, ignoring comment lines) from Dockerfile.nginx and build-gnu-libiconv.sh; otherwise it leaves FROM alpine:X.Y unchanged, warns when the current release is end-of-life, and treats Alpine network failures as a skipped check.",
